---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Privacy Policy | ContrastMap';
const description = 'How ContrastMap collects, uses, and shares your information — including the Get a quote form, newsletter signup, Near me location search, and advertising cookies from Google AdSense.';
const canonical = 'https://www.contrastmap.com/privacy';
---

<Base title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} ogType="website">
  <span id="top"></span>

  <section class="info-hero">
    <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="info-sub">A plain-English summary of what we collect, why, and the choices you have.</p>
  </section>

  <div class="info-body info-prose">
    <p class="info-date">Last updated: September 11, 2026</p>

    <p>This Privacy Policy describes how ContrastMap ("we," "us," or "our") collects, uses, and shares your personal information when you visit <a href="https://www.contrastmap.com">www.contrastmap.com</a> (the "Site").</p>

    <h2>Information We Collect</h2>

    <h3>Automatically Collected Information</h3>
    <p>When you visit the Site, we automatically collect certain information about your device, including your IP address, browser type, operating system, and the pages you view. We collect this information using cookies, log files, and similar technologies.</p>

    <h3>Location Information</h3>
    <p>If you use our <strong>"Near me"</strong> studio search or other location-based features, we may collect your location (city/region level) based on your IP address or browser geolocation settings. If you explicitly grant permission, your browser's geolocation is used to rank studios by distance. We do <strong>not</strong> store precise GPS coordinates — they are used only to run that search and are not retained.</p>

    <h3>User-Submitted Information</h3>
    <p>If you submit a studio review, a correction, a <strong>"Get a quote"</strong> request, a <strong>newsletter</strong> signup, or a contact form, we collect the information you provide, such as your name, email address, and message content.</p>

    <h3>Information from Third Parties</h3>
    <p>We source studio data (names, locations, amenities, hours) from public directories and studio submissions. This data is aggregated and displayed on the Site.</p>

    <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>To operate, maintain, and improve the Site and its features</li>
      <li>To respond to your inquiries and process your submissions</li>
      <li>To analyze usage trends and optimize the user experience</li>
      <li>To display personalized or contextual advertising through Google AdSense and similar partners</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Advertising and Cookies</h2>
    <p>We use <strong>Google AdSense</strong> to serve ads on the Site. Google, as a third-party vendor, uses cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to this Site and other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads to you based on your visit to our Site and/or other sites on the Internet.</p>
    <p>You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google Ads Settings at <a href="https://adssettings.google.com" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">adssettings.google.com</a>. Alternatively, you can opt out of a third-party vendor's use of cookies for personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.aboutads.info/choices/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">aboutads.info/choices</a>.</p>
    <p>You can also set your browser to refuse cookies or alert you when cookies are being sent. Note that some parts of the Site may not function properly without cookies.</p>

    <div class="info-card">
      <p><strong>Third-Party Ad Network Disclosure (required by Google AdSense)</strong></p>
      <p>Some of the ads on this Site are served by Google. Google's advertising requirements can be found at <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">policies.google.com/technologies/ads</a>. Google uses cookies and other technologies to collect and use data for advertising purposes. For more information, see Google's Privacy Policy at <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
    <p>We use the following third-party services:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Google AdSense</strong> (advertising)</li>
      <li><strong>Hosting and infrastructure providers</strong> (Cloudflare)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>These services may collect and process your data according to their own privacy policies.</p>
    <p><strong>Note on Google Analytics:</strong> ContrastMap does not currently use Google Analytics. If we add an analytics service in the future, we will update this policy to disclose it here.</p>

    <h2>Data Retention</h2>
    <p>We retain automatically collected information for as long as necessary to fulfill the purposes described above. User-submitted content (reviews, corrections) is retained unless you request its removal.</p>

    <h2>Your Rights</h2>
    <p>Depending on your location, you may have the right to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Access the personal information we hold about you</li>
      <li>Request correction or deletion of your personal information</li>
      <li>Object to or restrict certain processing activities</li>
      <li>Withdraw consent where processing is based on consent</li>
    </ul>
    <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@contrastmap.com">contact@contrastmap.com</a>.</p>

    <h2>Children's Privacy</h2>
    <p>The Site is not intended for children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children under 13. If you believe we have collected such information, contact us and we will delete it.</p>

    <h2>Changes to This Policy</h2>
    <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. We will post the updated version on this page with a revised "Last updated" date.</p>

    <h2>Contact Us</h2>
    <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, contact us at <a href="mailto:contact@contrastmap.com">contact@contrastmap.com</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
